A `---` inside a frontmatter value does not end the block: the keys after it are still checked,
and body lines keep their file numbers.

-- fixtures/cwd/.booping --
project_name: probe
vault_path: ./vault
latest_migration: 9999
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/value/0001-first.md --
---
type: value
title: First
summary: The first value.
kind: value
created_by: owner
created_at: 2026-01-01
updated_at: 2026-01-01
---

Why the project exists.

## In practice

It shows in every run.
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/rule/0001-keep-it-short.md --
---
type: rule
title: Keep it short
summary: Cut a---b from what the reader does not need.
created_by: owner
created_at: 2026-01-01
updated_at: 2026-01-01
status: accepted
values: [value/0001, value/9999]
---

## Rule

Keep it short.

